./logs/iter_015_idea_02_explorer_01.stderr.log:2414:- Lagziel and Lehrer (Journal of Economic Theory 2015), "Approachability with delayed information," is verified. It gives delayed-information approachability/no-regret background and is relevant to vector-deficit formulations of simultaneous-horizon constraints; it does not prove the known-path finite-prefix LP or compactness criterion.
